{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build two worlds at once - or focus on just one to shape the realm of your dreams.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax with this mix of a puzzle and strategy game, while listening to calming music and enjoying the creation of different worlds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00b0- Build a beautiful world - or two worlds at once\u00a0-\u00b0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect hexagonal tiles to grow distinct biomes. Will you manage both landscapes in harmony, or pour your focus into one? Every approach leads to a unique outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d5b3410a0fd766fa303d2a12ca141664.poster.avif?t=1758007162\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d5b3410a0fd766fa303d2a12ca141664.webm?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d5b3410a0fd766fa303d2a12ca141664.mp4?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00b0- A relaxing strategy game\u00a0-\u00b0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your mind wander while your strategy unfolds. Every tile placed brings you closer to a harmonious landscape. Connect matching edges to perfect your tiles and expand your board even further.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/51bed70bc177dad8cd3c64044dde2c96.poster.avif?t=1758007162\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/51bed70bc177dad8cd3c64044dde2c96.webm?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/51bed70bc177dad8cd3c64044dde2c96.mp4?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00b0- Play at your own pace -\u00b0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no pressure and no time limit. Take your time, rotate tiles, plan ahead - or simply follow your intuition.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d810610734bdf413028f462edfe49e6a.poster.avif?t=1758007162\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d810610734bdf413028f462edfe49e6a.webm?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d810610734bdf413028f462edfe49e6a.mp4?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00b0- Mix and match mystical realms\u00a0-\u00b0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite worlds for each session. Want to pair Viking fjords with icy tundra? Heaven with hell? Or build a surreal blend of an elvish forest with Viking fjords? It's up to you. You start with two worlds, but the better you become, the more worlds you will unlock. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/1b58c29456538b7b8b006a79527aa9a1.avif?t=1758007162\" width=1404 height=738 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00b0- Express your creativity\u00a0-\u00b0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Creative Mode, you're free to build without limits. Design a tranquil landscape, create pixel-like art with tiles - it's your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/af5ad0d80ded559bdbebc5452c19d0b4.avif?t=1758007162\" width=1600 height=902 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00b0- Unlock special tiles for each world while you play\u00a0-\u00b0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world has special tiles that can be placed on any tiles of the same world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/fa2acd81180a31aa9c95c79e96b74d7b.poster.avif?t=1758007162\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/fa2acd81180a31aa9c95c79e96b74d7b.webm?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/fa2acd81180a31aa9c95c79e96b74d7b.mp4?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3872220?t=1758007162","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/9a30d724ab47462dd211a52ef1411c9332b58f78/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758007162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/afb1402013f380ee8fdb6be0e6def0b7c2317241/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758007162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/afb1402013f380ee8fdb6be0e6def0b7c2317241/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758007162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d559e6a73d4be04460edb3f66fd7b579.avif?t=1758007162\" width=1600 height=1010 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build two worlds at once - or focus on just one to shape the realm of your dreams.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax with this mix of a puzzle and strategy game, while listening to calming music and enjoying the creation of different worlds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00b0- Build a beautiful world - or two worlds at once\u00a0-\u00b0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect hexagonal tiles to grow distinct biomes. Will you manage both landscapes in harmony, or pour your focus into one? Every approach leads to a unique outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d5b3410a0fd766fa303d2a12ca141664.poster.avif?t=1758007162\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d5b3410a0fd766fa303d2a12ca141664.webm?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d5b3410a0fd766fa303d2a12ca141664.mp4?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00b0- A relaxing strategy game\u00a0-\u00b0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your mind wander while your strategy unfolds. Every tile placed brings you closer to a harmonious landscape. Connect matching edges to perfect your tiles and expand your board even further.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/51bed70bc177dad8cd3c64044dde2c96.poster.avif?t=1758007162\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/51bed70bc177dad8cd3c64044dde2c96.webm?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/51bed70bc177dad8cd3c64044dde2c96.mp4?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00b0- Play at your own pace -\u00b0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no pressure and no time limit. Take your time, rotate tiles, plan ahead - or simply follow your intuition.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d810610734bdf413028f462edfe49e6a.poster.avif?t=1758007162\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d810610734bdf413028f462edfe49e6a.webm?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872220/extras/d810610734bdf413028f462edfe49e6a.mp4?t=1758007162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00b0- Mix and match mystical realms\u00a0-\u00b0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite worlds for each session. Want to pair Viking fjords with icy tundra? Heaven with hell? Or build a surreal blend of an elvish forest with Viking fjords? It's up to you. You start with two worlds, but the better you become, the more worlds you will unlock. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: